omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xLwMbzebDZ4Q7kNvwE7h2LE&_nc_oc=Adro31WFiCcdXoKIy1fkzsYzCal4Yv2RumFR-QBvKbnXgy-96QXelKMyEj6TAZy3x0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJzYvqqBbt_94F7sf25RyevV6998keLsiFXSh_4lbs4dQ&oe=6AA6BFB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4zaWxbnJt7AQ7kNvwEW-w8D&_nc_oc=AdqaiEXoO2TJRIQibIUR05nzi0zG3ZL9cPZ4xeylcADTSgJRTP7iDLnK-JDyrDFhCWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKZT5Z4Q7u-bsVPqBFi2aZUnAE7NQWEPm-2RC7zDXUs6g&oe=6AA6C116"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4tn2BIjUPKoQ7kNvwFXMala&_nc_oc=AdogWe5elbI5CcDRm-Zqs1anihzomzT59xyMx7oUkVPExGTXrM_FsY3gDIoEEfZzVjo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIiLm5CLbw0WAxAdbWWDVCfU99leip6P-MbsldsPKKU2g&oe=6AA69DF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://